    <!-- Panel notices -->
    <string name="phone_overlay_running_you">Nothing needed right now.</string>
    <string name="phone_overlay_running_foot">Pause only refuses new actions; the agent can still observe. Take over revokes this access. Neither undoes actions already sent.</string>
    <string name="phone_overlay_pausing_notice">Until confirmed, the agent may still be finishing its last action. No need to press Pause again.</string>
    <string name="phone_overlay_paused_notice">No new actions are accepted; the last one still needs checking. The agent can still observe this app until you take over, open AndChamber or end the task.</string>
    <string name="phone_overlay_taking_notice">Until confirmed, the last action may still take effect. No need to press again.</string>
    <string name="phone_overlay_taken_notice">New observation and actions are off; the last action still needs checking. The agent won\'t take control back by itself.</string>
    <string name="phone_overlay_need_user_pending_notice">The agent asked for a person (its note isn\'t verified). Until this is confirmed, don\'t type anything sensitive here.</string>
    <string name="phone_overlay_need_user_notice">Your turn: new observation and actions are off; the last action still needs checking. Do this step yourself, and don\'t send passwords to the agent.</string>
    <string name="phone_overlay_need_user_foot">This comes from the agent\'s request. AndChamber doesn\'t detect every login or sensitive page.</string>
    <string name="phone_overlay_unknown_notice">An action was sent, but whether it took effect couldn\'t be confirmed. It may already have happened.</string>
    <string name="phone_overlay_unknown_foot">There is no retry here: repeating the action could do it twice.</string>
    <string name="phone_overlay_unconfirmed_notice">The stop request timed out. The agent may still be acting, and the last action may have taken effect. Open AndChamber; the notification also leads there.</string>
    <string name="phone_overlay_unconfirmed_foot">Asking again only asks it to stop; nothing is re-sent. This stays until the stop is confirmed.</string>
    <string name="phone_overlay_ending_notice">This stays until access is revoked. The last action may still take effect.</string>
    <string name="phone_overlay_ended_you">Check in the app that the result is really there.</string>
    <string name="phone_overlay_unavailable_notice">Live controls can\'t be shown here right now. Use AndChamber or its notification.</string>
    <string name="phone_overlay_continue_foot">To let the agent continue, confirm again in AndChamber; it reads the screen again first. This overlay can\'t grant or extend access.</string>
    <string name="phone_overlay_result_native">Native</string>
    <string name="phone_overlay_result_sent">Sent</string>
